# Mysteries of Beadeaux II (jeuno 32): Lower Jeuno's Sattal-Mansal (no script; default 96). An accepted section only
# (flagged by Mysteries of Beadeaux I's 89). A level 75 Warrior with two Quadav Augury Shells and a Chocobo Feather, no
# Silver Bell (Mysteries of Beadeaux I silent). Available: a trade: no section, nothing. Accepted (a GM, as I's 89 does):
# no trigger handler: 96; two shells: nil; a shell and the feather: nil; the feather: nil; a shell: the Black Matinee
# Necklace added (no message), fame +7 x3, the trade completed, 92; finished: completed (player:completeQuest),
# KEYITEM_OBTAINED (the necklace). Completed: no section: 96.
lists LowerJeuno/Sattal-Mansal/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Sattal-Mansal/onTrade LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/92
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=42.6,3.9,-54 job=WAR lvl=75
item QuadavAuguryShell x2
item ChocoboFeather
login
trade Sattal-Mansal QuadavAuguryShell x1 # available: no section; nothing
quest Jeuno.MysteriesOfBeadeauxIi accepted # a GM: I's 89 finish does this
trigger Sattal-Mansal               # accepted: no trigger handler; 96
finish
trade Sattal-Mansal QuadavAuguryShell x2 # two: nil
trade Sattal-Mansal QuadavAuguryShell x1 ChocoboFeather x1 # an extra item: nil
trade Sattal-Mansal ChocoboFeather x1 # no shell: nil
trade Sattal-Mansal QuadavAuguryShell x1 # the Black Matinee Necklace (no message), fame +7 x3, the shell taken; 92
finish                              # completed (no reward table); KEYITEM_OBTAINED
trigger Sattal-Mansal               # completed: no section; 96
finish
